WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.890
Ever wondered about the deepest secret desire
of SCP-106, the Old Man who drags unsuspecting

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.410
victims into his hellish pocket dimension?

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:15.030
Foundation researchers snapped a picture of
SCP-106 as he emerged from a wall, using SCP-978,

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.260
the Desire Camera.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.010
This was the result:

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.490
"SCP-106 roaming a wheat field.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:24.720
Appears to be approaching an old farmhouse,
while a woman, appearing to be in her mid-sixties,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.590
welcomes 106."

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:31.930
SCP-106's origins are uncertain, but it has
always seemed clear that he desired fear and

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.680
violence over all else.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:38.590
This photograph tells a different story, one
of a man who wants comfort, love, and a home

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:39.610
of his own.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:43.770
It's a fascinating look into the innermost
desires of someone that seems like a simple

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:44.770
monster.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:49.640
Sadly, he will never have the home he yearns
for, condemned to hunt forever and destroy

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.250
everything he touches.

